{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1394236800, "end_date": 1394927999, "month_true_total": 229, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9489618", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027059521", "personaname": "pomgoe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pomgoe/", "num_games_owned": 233, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3061, "last_played": 1651505826, "avatar": "e1060f50a8f2ab2bf2c9e570b903e1ecb5b3f658"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had (and will have) so much fun playing this game. It's challenging but not frustrating and there's a wide range of play-styles. It has rogue-like elements so you can play it over and over. I really like the art style and soundtrack too. The only bad thing is that it sometimes doesn't load sounds properly and I have to either play without sound or restart the computer (and I'm not alone).", "timestamp_created": 1394901147, "timestamp_updated": 1394903898, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9488228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073607609", "personaname": "Greg The Egg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073607609/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 339, "last_played": 1508463029, "avatar": "a1835fdb6fe66811dbc202900053a3c47b1b5962"}, "language": "english", "review": "Of the many \"rogue-like\" games I have played, this is by far the most enjoyable.  Great combat system, character variety, and difficulty that scales with time all make this an intense game.  Tons of fun with excellent music.  Highly, highly reccomended.", "timestamp_created": 1394891698, "timestamp_updated": 1394891698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9485041", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976944409", "personaname": "Thet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Thetwodud/", "num_games_owned": 687, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 8316, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7873, "last_played": 1527611860, "avatar": "963f332d04ccf72281c793ec0481967799bbfb08"}, "language": "english", "review": "An amazing and addictive rogue-like game featuring scaling difficulty, a wide variety of playable characters, great atmosphere and music, challenging unlocks, and a wonderful dose of randomization. If you like games with randomized elements and a healthy amount of frenzied action, then it's hard to go wrong with Risk of Rain.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIRXPgCfaII", "timestamp_created": 1394869663, "timestamp_updated": 1422489308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9484476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116292298", "personaname": "Seededacorn", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Seededacorn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 6175, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2861, "last_played": 1544064791, "avatar": "bf2be838772bbe9c6961c435c4130802a2749620"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got shat on by electric 200 foot long worm. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1394863957, "timestamp_updated": 1394863957, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.570745527744293213", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9484250", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122498836", "personaname": "MettaMatt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mettamatt/", "num_games_owned": 923, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1664, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 577, "last_played": 1528445031, "avatar": "651b3108548094ff2d908f38c498055b77a9f5d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "TThis game is very appealing for many reasons. It perfectly fits the rogue-like tags it is associated with and the difficulty is exrtreme all the time. The best part of the whole thing, however, is the infinite replayability. Every playthrough is different. Not just in the level design and order, which has many variations. The way the enemies spawn and where is always different, and they grow more difficult as you play, on and on for about 45 minutes until max difficulty. This game is worth a look at, and definitely a purchase. Buy it, ladies and gentleman.", "timestamp_created": 1394861807, "timestamp_updated": 1394861807, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502712488174438477", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}